            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "RemoteCompose serializes UI trees and drawing commands into a compact binary format for playback on remote devices. It supports dynamic expressions, animations, layout, and interactivity without requiring full re-serialization.",
              "font_size": 15.0,
              "color": "#FF424242"
            },
            {
              "type": "box",
              "modifier": { "height": 16 }
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "The system is organized into three layers: Creation handles the host-side API and DSL, the Wire Format defines the binary protocol and opcodes, and Playback manages rendering and interaction on the client device.",
              "font_size": 15.0,
              "color": "#FF616161"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
